<%
  # The "Reserve a spot for your club" form (WEB-33, redesigned in WEB-34).
  # Our own HTML, posting straight to one Kit form's subscribe endpoint (SAI
  # Kit account), because Kit's form builder only does text fields. Each
  # answer goes into the matching Kit custom field, `fields[<key>]`. A Kit
  # rule adds the tags Orcarra and no-auto-sai, so the page sends no tags.
  # Only name and email are required; the "Help shape Orcarra" block is
  # optional. orcarra_price_ok (Yes / Maybe / No) is new in WEB-34 (Kit
  # custom field ID 1441280).
  #
  # frontend/javascript/index.js submits it in the background, fires the
  # Fathom event orcarra-signup on success, and swaps in the thank-you text
  # in place, with no page change, so the ad-click tags stay on the visit.
  # It holds the card's height so nothing moves. Without JavaScript it's a
  # plain post to Kit.
%>
<form class="form-card" action="https://app.kit.com/forms/<%= form_id %>/subscriptions" method="post"
      data-reserve-form data-fathom-event="orcarra-signup">
  <div class="reserve-fields">
    <h2>Reserve a spot for your club</h2>
    <p class="intro">Orcarra is under development. Reserve a spot and your club is among the first to try it, and helps shape it. No card, no payment, and no commitment.</p>

    <div class="fields">
      <div class="f">
        <label for="reserve-name">Your name</label>
        <input id="reserve-name" type="text" name="fields[first_name]" autocomplete="name" required />
      </div>
      <div class="f">
        <label for="reserve-email">Email</label>
        <input id="reserve-email" type="email" name="email_address" autocomplete="email" required />
      </div>
      <div class="f">
        <label for="reserve-club-type">Type of club</label>
        <select id="reserve-club-type" name="fields[orcarra_club_type]">
          <option value="">Choose one</option>
          <option>User group</option>
          <option>Hobby or sports club</option>
          <option>Society or association</option>
          <option>HOA</option>
          <option>Other nonprofit</option>
          <option>Other</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="f">
        <label for="reserve-members">Number of members</label>
        <select id="reserve-members" name="fields[orcarra_members]">
          <option value="">Choose one</option>
          <option>Under 30</option>
          <option>30–100</option>
          <option>101–200</option>
          <option>Over 200</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="f full">
        <label for="reserve-role">Your role</label>
        <select id="reserve-role" name="fields[orcarra_officer_role]">
          <option value="">Choose one</option>
          <option>President or chair</option>
          <option>Secretary</option>
          <option>Treasurer</option>
          <option>Other officer or board member</option>
          <option>Member</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="opt">
      <h3>Help shape Orcarra <span class="opt-note">(optional)</span></h3>
      <p class="hint">A few quick questions, so we build for the way your club runs.</p>
      <div class="f q">
        <label for="reserve-tool">What does your club use today for email, documents and elections?</label>
        <textarea id="reserve-tool" name="fields[orcarra_tool_today]" rows="2"></textarea>
      </div>
      <fieldset class="f q choice">
        <legend>Would the price for your club's size work for you? ($29 a month up to 100 members, $49 up to 200. Planned prices.)</legend>
        <div class="seg">
          <label><input type="radio" name="fields[orcarra_price_ok]" value="Yes" /> Yes</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="fields[orcarra_price_ok]" value="Maybe" /> Maybe</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="fields[orcarra_price_ok]" value="No" /> No</label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset class="f q choice">
        <legend>May we talk with you for 30 minutes about how your club runs?</legend>
        <div class="seg">
          <label><input type="radio" name="fields[orcarra_talk_ok]" value="Yes" /> Yes</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="fields[orcarra_talk_ok]" value="No" /> No</label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>
    </div>

    <div class="submit">
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Reserve a spot for your club</button>
      <p class="reserve-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
    <p class="fine">We'll use your email only for news about Orcarra and, if you said yes, to set up a conversation. Nothing else.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="reserve-thanks" data-reserve-thanks hidden tabindex="-1">
    <p><strong>Your club's spot is reserved.</strong> Your club will be among the first to try Orcarra, and we'll ask what you think. If you said yes to a conversation, we'll be in touch to set one up.</p>
  </div>
</form>
